Subject: IP: Treat 240.0.0.0/4 as host addresses

Some networks use the reserved 240.0.0.0/4 range like a private range.
Classify it as site-scope host addresses, and keep 255.255.255.255 as
broadcast.

Squashed from these projectcalico/bird commits, oldest first. Each keeps
its author and message.

commit 5cc183424d9ffb898171ef16360c400414f91bf0
Author: Neil Jerram <neil@tigera.io>
Date:   2021-06-30

